# This project deliberately has no browser-side secret variables.
#
# Keep these only in Supabase Edge Function Secrets, never here:
# STRIPE_SECRET_KEY
# STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET
# SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY
#
# The Supabase project URL and publishable key in dist/app.js are public client
# configuration. Security is provided by Supabase Auth, Row Level Security,
# and the trusted Edge Functions.
